<sup>+17</sup> X is a super-key for R.#{3}":[10,10],"#Multivalued Dependency and Fourth Normal Form#Definition: A Relation Schema R is in 4NF with respect to a set of dependencies F (that includes functional deps. and multivalued deps.) if, for every _nontrivial_ multivaled dependency X ->-> Y in F<sup>+17</sup> X is a super-key for R.#{4}":[11,11],"#Multivalued Dependency and Fourth Normal Form#Example:":[12,17],"#Multivalued Dependency and Fourth Normal Form#Example:#(a) EMP":[13,14],"#Multivalued Dependency and Fourth Normal Form#Example:#(a) EMP#{1}":[14,14],"#Multivalued Dependency and Fourth Normal Form#Example:#(b) EMP_PROJECTS":[15,17],"#Multivalued Dependency and Fourth Normal Form#Example:#(b) EMP_PROJECTS#{1}":[16,17],"#Activity for 3NF, BCNF, 4NF, and 5NF":[18,19],"#Activity for 3NF, BCNF, 4NF, and 5NF#{1}":[19,19]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"updated_at":"2026-03-30T15:44:36.937+05:30","edited_seconds":470,"tags":["#DBMS"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},
